{"4643930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Serve Or Die", "steam_appid": 4643930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Or Die</strong> is a psychological horror game where you work alone in a small sandwich shop during the night shift.<br><br>Prepare orders, serve customers, and keep the business running… but something isn’t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange customers start showing up.<br>Some of them act normal.<br>Some of them don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first entry in the <i>Serve Or Die</i> experience, introducing players to a stylized, VHS-inspired world where simple tasks slowly turn into something far more disturbing<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643930/extras/115ef6172c8410acc939c50e380390a8.poster.avif?t=1787683508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643930/extras/115ef6172c8410acc939c50e380390a8.webm?t=1787683508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643930/extras/115ef6172c8410acc939c50e380390a8.mp4?t=1787683508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Or Die</strong> is a psychological horror game set in a small sandwich shop during the night shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, prepare sandwiches, and serve customers.<br>At first, everything feels normal… but it quickly turns strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers act unusual.<br>Some know more than they should.<br>Some shouldn’t be there at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the simplest tasks become tense and unpredictable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im